* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css       diff=css
*.html      diff=html
*.md        diff=markdown
*.php       diff=php

# Keep dev-only files out of `composer install --prefer-dist` archives.
#
# README.md is deliberately NOT export-ignored. The 00bb repo marks it
# export-ignore, and that silently dropped every package README when files were
# moved with `git archive` during Phase 0 of the consolidation — 31 of 34 files
# arrived and each package was short by exactly one, which is invisible unless
# you count. A package's README is the first thing a consumer reads; it belongs
# in the distributed archive.
/.github        export-ignore
/phpstan.neon   export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
.gitignore      export-ignore
